  "Neural Rendering source: DLSS5 Feeder": "神经渲染来源：DLSS5 Feeder",
  "This game has no native DLSS, so there's no DLSS call for OptiScaler to add Neural Rendering to. The Feeder synthesises one from ReShade's own depth and motion vectors -- estimated, so it ghosts more in fast motion than a native-DLSS-fed game. Deploys ReShade (as a plain ReShade64.dll, not a proxy), the Feeder add-on, and a motion-vector shader here; install OptiScaler normally afterward (Install button) -- it loads ReShade itself once installed, not the other way round.": "此游戏没有原生 DLSS，所以没有可供 OptiScaler 叠加神经渲染的 DLSS 调用。Feeder 用 ReShade 自己的深度和运动矢量合成一个 -- 这是估算值，因此快速运动时的重影会比原生 DLSS 游戏更多。会在此部署 ReShade（作为普通的 ReShade64.dll，而不是代理）、Feeder 插件和一个运动矢量着色器；之后照常安装 OptiScaler（安装按钮）-- 安装后由 OptiScaler 自己加载 ReShade，而不是反过来。",
