  "Frame Generation via Lossless Scaling": "通过 Lossless Scaling 进行帧生成",
  "Lossless Scaling generates extra frames from outside the game entirely -- it never touches the game's swapchain, so it works for games that have no DLSS of their own -- DX11 titles, DLSS5 Feeder and Luma UE games -- where neither the game nor OptiScaler's own Frame Generation can run. It is not offered for games with native DLSS: those have NVIDIA's own Frame Generation in their video settings (versioned above). Separate paid app; this only configures its per-game profile (Frame Generation on, Scaling off), it doesn't install it. <strong>Fixed</strong> multiplies every frame; <strong>Adaptive</strong> generates only as many frames as needed to hold the target FPS you set. <strong>One frame generator at a time:</strong> configuring this turns OptiScaler's own Frame Generation off for this game, and the game's own DLSS Frame Generation must be off in its video settings while Lossless Scaling runs -- two generators stack their frames. Once configured, the on/off toggle (and the amount, in Fixed mode) live in this game's own in-game panel (DLSS 5 Neural Rendering, Alt+Home). <strong>Requires this game running Borderless or Windowed, not exclusive Fullscreen</strong> -- Lossless Scaling cannot capture an exclusive-fullscreen window at all; a DX12 game is usually fine regardless since DX12 has no true exclusive fullscreen.": "Lossless Scaling 完全在游戏外部生成额外的帧 -- 它从不触碰游戏的交换链，因此对没有自带 DLSS 的游戏也有效 -- DX11 游戏、DLSS5 Feeder 和 Luma UE 游戏 -- 在这些游戏里游戏本身和 OptiScaler 自带的帧生成都无法运行。不向有原生 DLSS 的游戏提供：那些游戏在视频设置里有 NVIDIA 自己的帧生成（版本在上方管理）。它是单独的付费应用；这里只配置它的每游戏配置文件（帧生成开，缩放关），不会安装它。<strong>Fixed</strong> 按倍数生成每一帧；<strong>Adaptive</strong> 只生成维持你设定的目标 FPS 所需的帧。<strong>一次只能有一个帧生成器：</strong>配置此项会关闭此游戏的 OptiScaler 自带帧生成，并且在 Lossless Scaling 运行期间，游戏自己的 DLSS 帧生成必须在其视频设置中关闭 -- 两个生成器会叠加各自的帧。配置完成后，开关（以及 Fixed 模式下的倍数）位于此游戏自己的游戏内面板（DLSS 5 神经渲染，Alt+Home）。<strong>要求此游戏以无边框或窗口模式运行，而不是独占全屏</strong> -- Lossless Scaling 完全无法捕获独占全屏窗口；DX12 游戏通常没问题，因为 DX12 没有真正的独占全屏。",
