  "<strong>Press the Home key in-game.</strong> This opens Luma's own overlay -- it is separate from OptiScaler's menu (Alt+Home) and won't appear unless deploy actually succeeded.": "<strong>在游戏内按 Home 键。</strong>这会打开 Luma 自己的覆盖层 -- 它与 OptiScaler 的菜单（Alt+Home）是分开的，如果部署没有真正成功就不会出现。",
  "<strong>Select DLSS as the upscaling method inside Luma's overlay.</strong> This is the step that actually matters: until DLSS is chosen here, the game keeps using its own stock TAA, no DLSS call ever happens, and OptiScaler's Neural Rendering panel will keep saying \"waiting for the upscaler to run\" indefinitely -- correctly, because nothing is running for it to hook yet.": "<strong>在 Luma 的覆盖层中选择 DLSS 作为超采样方式。</strong>这是真正关键的一步：在这里选中 DLSS 之前，游戏会继续使用原有的 TAA，不会发生任何 DLSS 调用，OptiScaler 的神经渲染面板会一直显示“等待超采样器运行”-- 这是对的，因为还没有任何可供它挂钩的东西在运行。",
