  "Launched. Reach gameplay, play a minute, quit -- this checks the new log by itself.": "已启动。进入游玩画面，玩一分钟后退出，这里会自动检查新日志。",
  "New run checked: {verdict}": "已检查新运行：{verdict}",
  "Asking…": "询问中…",
  "Sending this game's logs and the app's view to Claude ({model}). Each change it wants is confirmed with you first.": "正在把此游戏的日志和应用信息发送给 Claude（{model}）。它想做的每项更改都会先征求你的确认。",
  "AI help failed: {error}": "AI 帮助失败：{error}",
  "AI verdict: DLSS 5 should work here now. Launch and reach gameplay to confirm.": "AI 判定：DLSS 5 现在应该可以在此运行。启动并进入游玩画面以确认。",
  "AI verdict: DLSS 5 is not currently available for this game.": "AI 判定：此游戏目前无法使用 DLSS 5。",
  "AI ended without a clear verdict.": "AI 结束时没有明确判定。",
  "Launch and check": "启动并检查",
  "Save bundle to share": "保存分享包",
  "AI help (optional, paid by you)": "AI 帮助（可选，由你付费）",
  "When Game Help has no rule for a problem, \"Ask AI\" sends that game's logs and the app's own view to Claude on your Anthropic API key, and Claude may apply the same fixes the app has, each one confirmed with you first. You pay Anthropic directly for what you use; nothing is sent until you press Ask AI. Keys start with sk-ant-.": "当游戏帮助没有对应规则时，“询问 AI”会用你的 Anthropic API 密钥把该游戏的日志和应用信息发送给 Claude，Claude 可以应用与应用相同的修复，每项都先征求你的确认。你直接向 Anthropic 支付用量费用；在你按下询问 AI 之前不会发送任何内容。密钥以 sk-ant- 开头。",
  "Anthropic API key (sk-ant-…)": "Anthropic API 密钥（sk-ant-…）",
  "Report on GitHub": "在 GitHub 上报告",
  "In Prey: Options > Display > Anti-Aliasing: TAA (or SMAA 2TX)": "在 Prey 中：选项 > 显示 > 抗锯齿：TAA（或 SMAA 2TX）",
  "DLSS 5 is working here: Neural Rendering ran {count} passes on the last run{fps}. A 32-bit game cannot run DLSS itself, so the neural pass and OptiScaler run in the 64-bit helper beside the game -- which is why nothing of OptiScaler appears in the game on its own. To change settings, use Edit here while the game runs: on this route the helper reads its settings file again within a second, so every change applies live. The Feeder's \"Show the DLSS 5 panel in-game\" only draws a picture of the helper's window over the game; clicks land on the game underneath, so its controls cannot be used there. To use OptiScaler's own panel, tick \"Show the DLSS 5 host window\" under Home > Add-ons > DLSS 5 Feed, alt-tab to that window, click inside it once, and press Insert.": "DLSS 5 在此正常运行：上次运行中 Neural Rendering 执行了 {count} 次{fps}。32 位游戏无法自己运行 DLSS，所以神经渲染和 OptiScaler 运行在游戏旁边的 64 位助手中——这就是游戏里看不到 OptiScaler 的原因。要修改设置，请在游戏运行时使用这里的“编辑”：在此路线上，助手会在一秒内重新读取设置文件，每项修改都会立即生效。Feeder 的“Show the DLSS 5 panel in-game”只是在游戏上方绘制助手窗口的画面；点击会落到下面的游戏里，所以无法在那里操作。要使用 OptiScaler 自己的面板，请在 Home > Add-ons > DLSS 5 Feed 中勾选“Show the DLSS 5 host window”，用 Alt+Tab 切换到该窗口，在其中点击一次，然后按 Insert。",
  "Change settings in Edit here while the game runs -- they apply live": "在游戏运行时于“编辑”中修改设置——立即生效",
  "Or: Home > Add-ons > DLSS 5 Feed > tick \"Show the DLSS 5 host window\"": "或：Home > Add-ons > DLSS 5 Feed > 勾选“Show the DLSS 5 host window”",
  "Alt-tab to that window, click in it, press Insert": "用 Alt+Tab 切到该窗口，点击其中，按 Insert",
  "Working -- change settings in Edit (the panel is in the 64-bit helper)": "正常运行——在“编辑”中修改设置（面板位于 64 位助手中）",
  "Nothing of OptiScaler appears in the game itself, because it runs in that helper. Change its settings in Edit while the game runs: on this route they apply live. The Feeder's \"Show the DLSS 5 panel in-game\" is only a picture of the helper's window and takes no clicks; to use OptiScaler's own panel, tick \"Show the DLSS 5 host window\" (Home -> Add-ons -> DLSS 5 Feed), alt-tab to that window, click inside it and press Insert.": "OptiScaler 运行在该助手中，所以游戏里看不到它。请在游戏运行时于“编辑”中修改它的设置：在此路线上会立即生效。Feeder 的“Show the DLSS 5 panel in-game”只是助手窗口的画面，不接受点击；要使用 OptiScaler 自己的面板，请勾选“Show the DLSS 5 host window”（Home -> Add-ons -> DLSS 5 Feed），用 Alt+Tab 切到该窗口，点击其中并按 Insert。",
  "More FPS for this game: Lossless Scaling adds generated frames. Set the game to Borderless or Windowed in its own display settings: Lossless Scaling cannot capture exclusive fullscreen.": "为此游戏提升 FPS：Lossless Scaling 会添加生成帧。请在游戏自身的显示设置中改为无边框或窗口模式：Lossless Scaling 无法捕获独占全屏。",
  "Set up Lossless Scaling frame generation": "设置 Lossless Scaling 帧生成",
  "Want more FPS? Add frame generation with Lossless Scaling (the game must run Borderless or Windowed)": "想要更高 FPS？用 Lossless Scaling 添加帧生成（游戏须以无边框或窗口模式运行）",
  "On Vulkan, the DLSS5 Feeder runs inside ReShade, and ReShade only reaches a Vulkan game as a layer installed for the whole PC. None is installed, so the Feeder never loaded and nothing called DLSS. Run ReShade's own installer (the version with add-on support), pick this exe, choose Vulkan, then Install here again. Or switch the emulator to OpenGL, or to Direct3D if it has it, and pick the same API in Edit: those need no layer.": "在 Vulkan 下，DLSS5 Feeder 运行在 ReShade 内，而 ReShade 只能以全机安装的图层进入 Vulkan 游戏。当前没有安装该图层，所以 Feeder 从未加载，也没有任何 DLSS 调用。请运行 ReShade 自己的安装程序（支持插件的版本），选择此 exe 和 Vulkan，然后在这里重新点“安装”。或者把模拟器切到 OpenGL（或有的话 Direct3D），并在“编辑”中选同一 API：这些不需要图层。",
  "ReShade is installed as a Vulkan layer on this PC, but a build without add-on support, so the DLSS5 Feeder (an add-on) cannot load and nothing called DLSS. Reinstall ReShade with add-on support (its installer: \"Enable loading of add-ons\"), then Install here again.": "此电脑上的 ReShade 已作为 Vulkan 图层安装，但版本不支持插件，所以 DLSS5 Feeder（一个插件）无法加载，也没有 DLSS 调用。请用支持插件的方式重新安装 ReShade（安装程序中的“Enable loading of add-ons”），然后在这里重新点“安装”。",
  "ReShade's Vulkan layer with add-on support is installed, but it did not load in this program: the DLSS5 Feeder wrote no log at all. Run ReShade's installer once more for this exact exe and choose Vulkan (the layer only runs for programs it was set up for), check NVIDIA Smooth Motion is off for it, then launch again.": "支持插件的 ReShade Vulkan 图层已安装，但没有在此程序中加载：DLSS5 Feeder 没有写任何日志。请针对这个 exe 再运行一次 ReShade 安装程序并选择 Vulkan（图层只在为其设置过的程序中运行），确认已为它关闭 NVIDIA Smooth Motion，然后重新启动。",
  "Install ReShade with add-on support for this exe, choosing Vulkan": "为此 exe 安装支持插件的 ReShade，选择 Vulkan",
  "Or switch the emulator to OpenGL and pick OpenGL in Edit": "或把模拟器切到 OpenGL，并在“编辑”中选 OpenGL",
  "Press Install here again": "在这里重新点“安装”",
